exports[`buildProjectTeamInviteEmail renders a full invitation: subject 1`] = `"Ada Lovelace invited your team to Difference Engine v2"`;

exports[`buildProjectTeamInviteEmail renders a full invitation: text 1`] = `
"Ada Lovelace invited your team to work on Difference Engine v2 on Proyekto.

Project: Difference Engine v2
Team: Analytical Engines Ltd
Your members join as: editor

"Would love your crew on the punch-card pipeline."

Accepting lets you choose which of your teams to bring and which of its members join. Nobody on your team gets access until you do.

You are being asked to make this the project’s primary team, which means its billing identity fills in contracts and its pay periods drive invoicing.

If you do not have an account yet, sign up with this email address and your invitation will be waiting for you.

View your invitation: https://app.proyekto.test/teams/me/invites?inviteId=6f1b2c3d-4e5f-4a6b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d

You received this email because someone invited one of your teams to a project on Proyekto."
`;

